cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your academic workflow, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Peer-Reviewed PDF App (Revisar e Numerar PDF)"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight, open-source web tool designed specifically for academic peer review 
  and student grading workflows. It runs 100% client-side in the browser, automating 
  line numbering and exporting revised PDFs with an expanded side margin to visually 
  anchor comments without overlapping the original text.
authors:
